   "bio": "Playful and goofy, the Ananous are a warm and welcoming family—as long as you don't mind the pranks! But there's more to them than just fun and games. Ekene Ananou, who spent his life as a modest artisan, is now raising his granddaughter Afua after her mother's passing. And the father? Well, no one knows who that truly is. Ekene says he was too different from the rest of them. It was a mutual agreement that Afua would stay an Ananou and grow up to have a \"regular life\", whatever that means. But many still gossip about the mystery. Some even swear they've seen some sizeable donations in the Ananou's mailbox.",
