   "bio": "Strength Through Union, the Darong's family motto. And united they've been for generations...but can it last forever? The old Adekoya, head of the Dynasty, has dreamed of his daughter Jawara becoming Queen since her youth. Over the years she proved herself a wonderful candidate, gathering favor across the kingdom through her philanthropic efforts. Her path to the crown seemed to be smoothly falling in place, right until the premature and sudden passing of her husband. As if that wasn't enough, with her growing popularity more rabble-rousers began to pry into the Darongs, probing into whether this seemingly perfect family had truly no Scandals to hide. As challenges pile on, Jawara forges ahead, mustering the strength of her beloved family to support her in the race to the crown.",
   "bioFrom": "EA"
  },
